==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|búa|lang=non}}.

===Verb===
'''búa''' (''strong conjugation:'' [[bjó]] – [[bjuggum]] – [[búið]])

# to [[reside]]
# to [[run]] a [[farm]] or [[home]]
# to [[prepare]]
# to [[dress]], [[decorate]]

